# A rectangle extruded; then on the home screen its sketch made active,
# and a second extrusion of it made there, which goes into the history
# between the sketch and the first extrusion; the same as
# path_insert_group.go makes (TestPathEquivalenceInsertGroup).
key r
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 380 330
down L 380 330
up L 380 330
key esc
key x shift
twmove 28 10
twdown L 28 10
twup L 28 10
twmove 28 135
twdown L 28 135
twup L 28 135
key x shift
